      "content": "<div style=\"font-family: ui-rounded, 'SF Pro Rounded', 'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; line-height:1.35;\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; padding:14px 16px; border-radius:16px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff7fb,#f2fbff); border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06); box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:18px; font-weight:700;\">给你来一盘 Mermaid 示例合集</div>\n    <div style=\"margin-left:auto;\">[[sticker:doro/开心]]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"height:12px;\"></div>\n\n  <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap:14px;\">\n    <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;\">1) Flowchart（流程图）</div>\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n  A[起床] --> B{今天要干嘛?}\n  B -->|学习| C[打开笔记]\n  B -->|摸鱼| D[刷短视频]\n  C --> E[写代码]\n  D --> E\n  E --> F[吃饭]\n```\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;\">2) Sequence Diagram（时序图）</div>\n\n```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n  participant U as User\n  participant A as App\n  participant S as Server\n  U->>A: 点击登录\n  A->>S: POST /login (账号+密码)\n  S-->>A: 200 OK + token\n  A-->>U: 登录成功\n```\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;\">3) State Diagram（状态图）</div>\n\n```mermaid\nstateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --> Idle\n  Idle --> Working: start\n  Working --> Paused: pause\n  Paused --> Working: resume\n  Working --> Done: finish\n  Done --> [*]\n```\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;\">4) Gantt（甘特图）</div>\n\n```mermaid\ngantt\n  title 小项目计划\n  dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD\n  section 研发\n  需求梳理       :done,    a1, 2026-03-01, 3d\n  原型设计       :active,  a2, 2026-03-04, 4d\n  开发实现       :         a3, 2026-03-08, 7d\n  section 测试&交付\n  测试修复       :         b1, 2026-03-15, 4d\n  上线           :milestone, b2, 2026-03-19, 1d\n```\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;\">5) Class Diagram（类图）</div>\n\n```mermaid\nclassDiagram\n  class User {\n    +String id\n    +String name\n    +login()\n  }\n  class Order {\n    +String orderId\n    +Date createdAt\n    +pay()\n  }\n  User \"1\" --> \"0..*\" Order : places\n```\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px;\">6) Pie（饼图）</div>\n\n```mermaid\npie title 今日能量分配\n  \"学习\" : 45\n  \"工作\" : 35\n  \"休息\" : 15\n  \"发呆\" : 5\n```\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"padding:14px 16px; border-radius:14px; background:#ffffff; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.06);\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-weight:700;\">想要我按你的场景定制吗？</div>\n        <div>[[sticker:doro/疑惑]]</div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:8px; color:rgba(0,0,0,.7);\">\n        你告诉我：要画「系统架构 / 业务流程 / 学习计划 / 数据关系」哪一种，我就给你做一套更贴合的 Mermaid（含配色与布局）。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
